WEBVTT

00:08:01.852 --> 00:08:02.853
(Music)

00:08:02.853 --> 00:08:04.563
Carissa Cabrera: [Good Blue News!!]

00:08:04.563 --> 00:08:09.318
[The endangered Hawaiian Monk seal
population is up to ...

00:08:09.318 --> 00:08:12.530
over 1,500!]

00:08:12.530 --> 00:08:17.076
[This is the highest
it’s been in decades!]

00:08:18.911 --> 00:08:21.247
Henry Ferland: Welcome back,
it is me, Trash Boy.

00:08:21.247 --> 00:08:24.917
Every time I step outside I see trash
and litter on the ground, and I hate it!

00:08:24.917 --> 00:08:26.043
So let’s clean some up!

00:08:26.043 --> 00:08:27.962
I got my trash bag and gloves, let’s go.

00:08:27.962 --> 00:08:30.214
One, two, three, four, five.